1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,818
Coherent Dreams is an AI morphology explorer built for the open web.

2
00:00:04,818 --> 00:00:11,817
It turns a deterministic scientific field into an interactive
landscape, then helps a visitor find and understand the structures
that deserve attention.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,569
Scientific simulations often finish as flat figures.

4
00:00:19,569 --> 00:00:24,340
Coherent Dreams turns one Cahn-Hilliard phase field into a place we
can explore.

5
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:29,112
This terrain represents phase separation across an imagined 2.56
micrometre nickel-aluminum film.

6
00:00:29,112 --> 00:00:32,782
Every peak and valley comes from the unchanged scalar source.

7
00:00:32,782 --> 00:00:38,287
The browser builds a mesh of 25,600 vertices and more than 50,000
triangles.

8
00:00:38,287 --> 00:00:46,729
Three.js selects WebGPU on capable devices and falls back to WebGL 2
elsewhere, so the same experience remains accessible without
specialist software.

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,475
The source view keeps scientific data and artistic interpretation
explicit.

10
00:00:58,475 --> 00:01:01,255
On the left is the unmodified simulation field.

11
00:01:01,255 --> 00:01:05,772
On the right is the human-directed Coherent Dreams artwork derived
from that field.

12
00:01:05,772 --> 00:01:11,331
The artwork supplies the visual palette, while the grayscale source
alone drives geometry, features, and measurements.

13
00:01:11,331 --> 00:01:17,239
The random seed, grid size, integration steps, parameters, and
imagined physical scale are archived with the project.

14
00:01:17,239 --> 00:01:22,451
This separation is deliberate: a compelling image can invite
exploration without being mistaken for evidence.

15
00:01:22,451 --> 00:01:26,968
Reviewers can reproduce the source and trace every displayed
measurement back to it.

16
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:42,575
Analysis happens locally in a Web Worker, so the field never needs
to leave the device.

17
00:01:42,575 --> 00:01:47,454
Each sample becomes a four-feature vector: composition, gradient
magnitude, absolute Laplacian, and local variance.

18
00:01:47,454 --> 00:01:51,287
A deterministic farthest-point initialization followed by k-means
discovers four morphology regimes.

19
00:01:51,287 --> 00:01:56,165
The region scout can search for rare signatures, active interfaces,
or representative phase interiors.

20
00:01:56,165 --> 00:02:02,438
Here it identifies an unusual nickel-rich patch and exposes the
gradient, curvature, and rarity evidence behind the rank.

21
00:02:02,438 --> 00:02:08,362
Cluster colors show the learned partition, while the right panel
explains why a specific region was selected.

22
00:02:08,362 --> 00:02:13,937
This is machine learning used as a transparent guide to attention,
not as a hidden oracle.

23
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:27,372
Interface mode suppresses phase interiors and emphasizes transition
boundaries.

24
00:02:27,372 --> 00:02:34,115
The scout ranks eight spatially separated regions, which prevents
one energetic neighborhood from filling the entire recommendation
list.

25
00:02:34,115 --> 00:02:37,112
Focus camera moves directly to the selected patch.

26
00:02:37,112 --> 00:02:44,230
Relief and phase threshold can be changed for visual inspection
while the underlying source and reported metrics remain fixed.

27
00:02:44,230 --> 00:02:50,599
The dashboard summarizes phase balance, interface density,
characteristic domain scale, structure-tensor anisotropy, normalized
entropy, and connected components.

28
00:02:50,599 --> 00:02:54,345
Each recommendation uses measured percentiles and a short grounded
explanation.

29
00:02:54,345 --> 00:03:03,711
The visitor can move from a global structure to one local claim, see
the evidence, and return to the full field without breaking spatial
context.

30
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:14,502
The model card explains the pipeline in plain language.

31
00:03:14,502 --> 00:03:18,781
Feature extraction, clustering, connected-component analysis, and
ranking are deterministic and inspectable.

32
00:03:18,781 --> 00:03:23,061
Recommendations come from fixed templates grounded in the measured
feature values.

33
00:03:23,061 --> 00:03:28,508
There is no remote model call, no prompt injection surface, and no
field upload.

34
00:03:28,508 --> 00:03:30,843
The app also states its limits.

35
00:03:30,843 --> 00:03:33,566
This simulated field is not calibrated microscopy.

36
00:03:33,566 --> 00:03:35,511
The physical scale is illustrative.

37
00:03:35,511 --> 00:03:39,013
Cluster names are descriptive rather than validated material labels.

38
00:03:39,013 --> 00:03:45,238
The interface is intended for exploration and communication, not for
process control, diagnosis, or materials decisions.

39
00:03:45,238 --> 00:03:52,241
Making those limits visible is part of the design, because
interpretability also means knowing where an inference stops.

40
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:57,876
Web3D makes relationships spatial, interactive, and shareable
through a link.

41
00:03:57,876 --> 00:04:02,915
The local pipeline keeps latency predictable and allows sensitive
fields to remain private.

42
00:04:02,915 --> 00:04:09,116
The same architecture can accept microscopy, climate, medical
imaging, manufacturing, fluid simulation, or other scalar data.

43
00:04:09,116 --> 00:04:16,093
New feature adapters and explanation templates can extend the scout
without replacing the renderer or the interaction model.

44
00:04:16,093 --> 00:04:20,745
Keyboard controls, reduced-motion support, responsive panels, and a
WebGL fallback widen access.

45
00:04:20,745 --> 00:04:30,047
Coherent Dreams demonstrates that an immersive scientific experience
can use AI to guide attention while keeping its source, evidence,
assumptions, and limits in view.

46
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:41,814
Coherent Dreams turns one reproducible field into an explorable
world, and one machine-learned ranking into evidence a person can
inspect.

47
00:04:41,814 --> 00:04:43,518
Thank you for exploring it.
